---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";

const title = "Privacy Policy – Morse Code Generator";
const description =
  "Privacy policy for MorseCodeGenerator.com. Learn what data is collected, how analytics and ads work, and how we handle text you translate.";
const canonical = "https://morsecodegenerator.com/privacy/";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: {new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}</p>

    <div class="card">
      <p>
        <span class="chip">Short version</span>
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          The translator runs in your browser. We do not ask you to create an
          account.
        </li>
        <li>
          Your text may be processed locally in the page. We do not intentionally
          store the text you type into the translator.
        </li>
        <li>
          We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand site usage and Google
          AdSense to show ads. These services may use cookies and similar
          technologies.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      This website is operated as <strong>MorseCodeGenerator.com</strong>
      (the “Site”, “we”, “us”).
    </p>

    <h2>What data we collect</h2>
    <h3>1) Text you enter in the translator</h3>
    <p>
      The translator is designed to run locally in your browser. We do not
      intentionally collect or store the text you type or paste into the
      translator.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
      Note: Like most websites, standard web infrastructure (hosting/CDN/server
      logs) may record basic request data (for example IP address, user-agent,
      timestamps) for security and reliability. This is not used to read your
      translation input.
    </p>

    <h3>2) Analytics (Google Analytics / GA4)</h3>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics 4 to measure aggregated usage (for example: which
      pages are visited, approximate location, device type). This helps us
      improve the site.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        We configure analytics with IP anonymization where supported.
      </li>
      <li>
        Google may set cookies or use similar identifiers to provide analytics.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h3>3) Advertising (Google AdSense)</h3>
    <p>
      We use Google AdSense to display ads. Ad providers may use cookies or
      similar technologies to show relevant ads and measure performance.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and your choices</h2>
    <p>
      Cookies are small text files stored on your device. Third-party services
      like Google Analytics and Google AdSense may use cookies and similar
      technologies.
    </p>

    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Opt-out options</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>
          You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings.
        </li>
        <li>
          You can learn about Google’s advertising controls and opt-out options
          in Google’s settings and policy pages.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="muted">
        (If you want, we can add a cookie consent banner later depending on your
        target regions.)
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Sharing links</h2>
    <p>
      The translator may support shareable URLs that include the text you entered
      via a query parameter (for example <span class="k">/translate/?q=...</span>).
      If you share that link, anyone with the link can see the prefilled text in
      their browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Children’s privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This Site is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly
      collect personal information from children under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      We do not intentionally store translator input. Analytics and ad-related
      data retention is managed by the relevant providers (e.g., Google) under
      their own policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The “Last updated”
      date above reflects the latest version.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this policy, contact us at
      <a href="mailto:morsecodegenerator@gmail.com">morsecodegenerator@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
